PLACEHOLDER — this is not a real game executable.

This plain-text file stands in for the real BareGame.exe. This folder
deliberately has no game.json manifest: it shows the bare-executable
layout the catalog's scanner picks up on its own. Any file matching the
catalog's executable patterns (*.exe by default) becomes a game entry
named after the file, with no metadata.

Replace this file with the real BareGame.exe to use the example for
real. Until then the catalog still lists the game: a file that is not a
valid PE image is catalogued as a Windows executable with unknown
architecture rather than being dropped.
